eam/apps/1693660/extras/0c51ca2187a6bc663e6cb709ed1dd45c.webm?t=1643140425\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1693660/extras/0c51ca2187a6bc663e6cb709ed1dd45c.mp4?t=1643140425\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Key Features:</strong><br>- Turn-based card battles<br>- Different heroes with different talent trees<br>- A variety of items and potions<br>- Randomly generated<br>- Roguelite through permanent upgrades<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1693660/extras/4df46e2e0a3096bd266293a325763a47.poster.avif?t=1643140425\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1693660/extras/4df46e2e0a3096bd266293a325763a47.webm?t=1643140425\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1693660/extras/4df46e2e0a3096bd266293a325763a47.mp4?t=1643140425\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
